      "statement": "jwt sign reads keys with jose.WithUse(\"sig\") plus algorithm/kid/subtle/password options and enforces: public keys cannot sign, the JWK use must be sig or empty, an algorithm must be resolvable from --alg/JWK/guessing, jose.ValidateJWK passes, and --exp must be in the future unless --subtle.",
