      "statement": "Unless --subtle, jwt sign requires iss/aud/sub/exp claims and auto-generates a random 256-bit jti; signing produces compact serialization with typ JWT, a kid header unless hidden --no-kid, support for extra --header k=v pairs, and x5c/x5t header embeddings.",
